    "description": "The Forecast Insights API provides users with access to detailed forecasting data, enabling businesses to anticipate future trends and make informed decisions. This API allows consumers to retrieve forecasts based on historical data, seasonal patterns, and various influencing factors. Typical use cases include demand planning, inventory management, and sales strategy optimization. By leveraging this API, organizations can enhance predictive accuracy and develop data-driven strategies for growth.",
